sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant KfDef as KfDef Operator
    participant Repo as odh-manifests<br/>repo/image
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant NS as Target Namespace
    participant ModelCtrl as odh-model-controller<br/>8081/TCP health
    participant Istio as Istio API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>8080/TCP

    Note over Admin,NS: Flow 1: KfDef-Driven Platform Deployment

    Admin->>KfDef: Apply KfDef CR<br/>(odh-core / model-serving)
    KfDef->>Repo: Fetch manifests<br/>HTTPS / TLS<br/>GitHub token / image pull
    Repo-->>KfDef: Kustomize manifests<br/>(tar.gz archive)
    KfDef->>K8sAPI: Apply rendered manifests<br/>HTTPS / TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount bearer
    K8sAPI->>NS: Create resources<br/>(CRDs, Deployments, RBAC,<br/>Services, ConfigMaps)
    NS-->>K8sAPI: Resources created

    Note over ModelCtrl,Prom: Flow 2: Model Serving Controller Reconciliation

    ModelCtrl->>K8sAPI: Watch InferenceService CRs<br/>HTTPS / TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount bearer
    K8sAPI-->>ModelCtrl: InferenceService events
    ModelCtrl->>Istio: Create/Update VirtualService<br/>HTTPS / TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount bearer
    ModelCtrl->>Istio: Create/Update PeerAuthentication<br/>HTTPS / TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount bearer
    ModelCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Route, NetworkPolicy<br/>HTTPS / TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount bearer
    ModelCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceMonitor/PodMonitor<br/>HTTPS / TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount bearer
    Prom->>ModelCtrl: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP / 8080/TCP<br/>kube-rbac-proxy (TokenReview)
    ModelCtrl-->>Prom: Metrics response
